What is the difference between CompletableFuture.supplyAsync() and runAsync()?  

The main difference is that CompletableFuture.supplyAsync() returns a CompletableFuture containing a result from the asynchronous task, while CompletableFuture.runAsync() returns a CompletableFuture<Void> for tasks that have no return value. supplyAsync() is used for tasks that compute and return a value (like a Callable or Supplier), while runAsync() is used for tasks that only perform an action or have side effects (like a Runnable).
